COSMOS 0004-allow-config-exclude.patch rebased onto Kalico 5b59427.

In 5b59427 (38724040 "configfile: Allow passing variables to [include]")
an [include] header only records pending_include; the include is resolved
at the next header. The [!section] branch is unchanged from COSMOS and sits
beside it, so a pending include is resolved before the exclusion runs.

diff --git a/klippy/configfile.py b/klippy/configfile.py
--- a/klippy/configfile.py
+++ b/klippy/configfile.py
@@ -545,6 +545,15 @@ class PrinterConfig:

             if header and header.startswith("include "):
                 pending_include = header[8:].strip()
+            elif header and header.startswith("!"):
+                self._parse_config_buffer(buffer, filename, fileconfig)
+                section_name = header[1:].strip()
+                if not fileconfig.has_section(section_name):
+                    raise error(
+                        "Section '%s' does not exist for exclusion"
+                        % (section_name,)
+                    )
+                fileconfig.remove_section(section_name)
             else:
                 line = _INCLUDERE.sub(
                     lambda match: _fix_include_path(filename, match),
